      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Try the cables",
          "consequence": "Clever.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Strafe the cockpits",
          "consequence": "Direct.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "Imperial troops in the corridor and a hyperdrive that coughs.",
      "sceneTitle": "Falcon Won't Start",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay and fix it",
          "consequence": "Bold.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sublight escape",
          "consequence": "Desperate.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "Sensors lie. The swamp rises up to grab the landing skids.",
      "sceneTitle": "Dagobah Approach",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Trust the Force",
          "consequence": "Surrender.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Trust the panel",
          "consequence": "Stubborn.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "Vader's mask in your visor, and your saber already drawn.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Cave",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Drop the saber",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fight him",
          "consequence": "Reckless.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "Yoda says size matters not. The marsh disagrees.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lift the X-Wing",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Try",
          "consequence": "Hope.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Walk away",
          "consequence": "Doubt.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Never tell you the odds. The cockpit goes dark for a second.",
      "sceneTitle": "Asteroid Field",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Dive deeper",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Climb out",
          "consequence": "Cautious.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "A cave that breathes. The stars at its mouth like teeth.",
      "sceneTitle": "Space Slug",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Boost full",
          "consequence": "Quick.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Drift quiet",
          "consequence": "Stealth.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "A line of them on a Star Destroyer deck. One in green Mandalorian plate.",
      "sceneTitle": "Bounty Hunters",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hide on the hull",
          "consequence": "Cunning.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Run sublight",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "Lando smiles too wide and the dinner doors slide open on Vader at the head of the table.",
      "sceneTitle": "Cloud City Welcome",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Draw",
          "consequence": "Quick.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Drop the blaster",
          "consequence": "Smart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Han goes first, and Leia holds his face.",
      "sceneTitle": "Carbon Freeze",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Say it",
          "consequence": "Heart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't say it",
          "consequence": "Stoic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "Lando whispers there is a way out for the others, if you trust him now.",
      "sceneTitle": "Tunnels of Cloud City",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Trust him",
          "consequence": "Mercy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Refuse",
          "consequence": "Wary.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "Vader is patient and you are not. Sparks on a catwalk over nothing.",
      "sceneTitle": "Saber Duel",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Press the attack",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Defend",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "Boba Fett's prize lifted onto a transport while you bleed in a corridor.",
      "sceneTitle": "Carbonite Slab",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pursue Fett",
          "consequence": "Loyal.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pursue Vader",
          "consequence": "Duty.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "A hand cut. A truth offered. A long fall to nothing.",
      "sceneTitle": "Gantry Over the Reactor",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take his hand",
          "consequence": "Tempted.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let go",
          "consequence": "True.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "Lando at the controls, Leia at the cockpit, a voice in your mind saying her name.",
      "sceneTitle": "Falcon Sweeps Under",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Call her",
          "consequence": "Hope.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay still",
          "consequence": "Spent.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "It is fixed by a fussy gold droid pieced back together in a sack.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hyperdrive Sabotaged",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Trust it",
          "consequence": "Faith.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Limp on sublight",
          "consequence": "Practical.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Medical frigate, new hand, old face in the window.",
      "sceneTitle": "Rebel Fleet, Quiet",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Touch the glass",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn away",
          "consequence": "Hard.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "He will find Han or he will die trying.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lando's Vow",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Believe him",
          "consequence": "Hope.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Go yourself",
          "consequence": "Stubborn.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "The galaxy is wider and worse than yesterday, and you are still in it.",
      "sceneTitle": "Stars Again",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take the next mission",
          "consequence": "Soldier.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_train"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sit a moment",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_chase"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_quiet"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_train",
      "text": "You return to the swamp to finish what you started, and Yoda is shorter and stranger and entirely correct, again.",
      "sceneTitle": "Back to Dagobah",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Back to Dagobah"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_chase",
      "text": "You and Lando burn a hundred contacts and a half a dozen ships looking for one slab of carbonite across a galaxy that does not want it found.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Hunt for Fett",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Hunt for Fett"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_quiet",
      "text": "You learn to live with the new hand, and with the sentence, and you do not lie down. That is the lesson the Empire never expected anyone to learn.",
      "sceneTitle": "A New Hand",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "A New Hand"
    }
  ]
